# the live inspector's "Im Editor öffnen" under the app's manifest (ui/inspect_src.rs, ROADMAP §11
# stage 4; development builds): audiotest's PERMISSIONS has no `process` rule, so the editor is
# not started -- the inspector says so, the source can still be copied; the inspector makes no
# exception to the manifest
size 720 1000
inspect on
inspect select button:"Glocke (WAV)"
inspect expect source "apps/audiotest/src/main.rs:"
inspect editor "whoami"
click button:"Im Editor öffnen"
inspect expect note "(PERMISSIONS: process)"
inspect expect opened none
click button:"Quelle kopieren"
inspect expect note "Kopiert"
clip expect text
inspect editor none
inspect off
inspect expect idle
